      "sample_posts": [
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Amazing work by NVIDIA & Google on implementing auto-activation out of the box for Google's NCCL Plugin for ConnectX-7/8 NCCL. This was implemented due to feedback from SemiAnalysis a couple of quarters ago to massively improve the out-of-the-box experience on the GCP platform!",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2094666647202078861",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T14:00:20.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 75
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Hot Chips 2026 核心不是峰值 FLOPS，而是模型變大、KV cache 變長後，記憶體容量、頻寬與 scale-up 互連成為真正瓶頸。NVDA 轉向全棧 AI 工廠，AMD 硬體追近，OpenAI 與 AVGO 的客製 ASIC 時程加快。訓練與推論矽晶已明顯分流：訓練要規模與算力，推論更吃記憶體移動。PIM、CXL、3D-DRAM、純 SRAM",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2094665807725056185",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T13:57:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 23
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "OpenAI Jalapeño Jalapeño 是推論專用 ASIC，追求延遲、互動性與每瓦效率，功耗低於 GB200，並針對 KV cache 做記憶體切片。OAI 與 AVGO 九個月就做出初始 RTL，顯示客製晶片時程被壓縮。它證明 ASIC 在穩定、大規模推論上有成本優勢，但模型與硬體綁定深、軟體複雜，GPU 仍因彈性與生態占大多數場景。",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2094681410502324287",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T14:59:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 17
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Google TPU 8 重點不是規格，而是訓練與推論該分開做。TPU 8i 是記憶體頻寬晶片：大 SRAM、大 HBM、超高晶片間頻寬，服務推理、MoE、agentic 解碼。TPU 8t 則衝 Superpod 規模與訓練算力。Google 明確說：下一道牆是搬資料，不是堆 FLOPS。  LPX（Groq／NVIDIA）",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2094686695384080637",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T15:20:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 12
        }
      ]
    },
